Employment Type:
{{ $('Grab pending rating Rows').item.json.Type }}

Listed Benefits:
{{ $('Grab pending rating Rows').item.json.Benefits }}

FULL JOB DESCRIPTION:
{{ $('Grab pending rating Rows').item.json['Job Description'] }}

VERIFIED CANDIDATE CAREER PROFILE:

{{ JSON.stringify($('Load Rating Career Profile').first().json, null, 2) }}


Compare this job against the complete Career Profile, including professional experience, technical skills, education, and personal projects.

Return the category scores, total score, and reasoning in the required JSON format.

=Create a targeted resume and cover letter for the following position.

JOB TITLE:
{{ $('Grab pending Cover Letter Rows').item.json.Title }}

COMPANY:
{{ $('Grab pending Cover Letter Rows').item.json['Company Name'] }}

JOB DESCRIPTION:
{{ $('Grab pending Cover Letter Rows').item.json['Job Description'] }}

CANDIDATE MASTER PROFILE:
{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}

Analyze the job requirements and identify the most relevant verified skills, professional accomplishments, and personal projects.

Produce a compelling, accurate resume and cover letter. Make the writing specific to this employer and role.

Return the results in the JSON structure specified by the system message.

